OL,3,ADrought and hosepipe bans remain
OL,4,Adespite wettest week since early
OL,5,AFebruary
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore rain is in the forecast this week
OL,8,Fand while that will be welcome,
OL,9,Fsustained rainfall is needed to reverse
OL,10,Fdrought conditions.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
